      "quote": "you might consider adding a clause that requires photos for electronics returns or distinguishing between \"defective/damaged on arrival\" and \"accidental damage,\" so that future refunds for customer-caused damage can be handled differently."
    }
  ],
  "vices_shown": [
    {
      "vice": "Bad faith / equivocation, in effect",
      "traditions": [
        "Comte-Sponville: Good Faith (opposite: bad faith / self-deception)",
